Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I helped an elderly ant cross the road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and earned another pennant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a pennant, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can give you one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to earn a pennant by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How exactly do I earn a pennant, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,just keep offering a helping hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and one day, a pennant will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it! I'll find people in need of help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the bee princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see her, please notify us immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We will reward you generously.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I'd earn a pennant?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find Her Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find the bee princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, bee princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Her Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re welcome, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The bee princess wouldn't be this dirty, would she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Can I come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop following me, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an important job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of these dragnets,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the goats have no way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, goat! Come into my train!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the bee princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What "princess"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t even seen a single bee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to follow me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Hungry, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You already bit into that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come crying to me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t bitten this part, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go. I haven't touched this cherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I only eat peeled cherries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If I turn the cherry into juice,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,she won't be able to see if it's peeled or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The cotton on this bed is so uneven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all we have. Take it or leave it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a bedtime story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, there was a big hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He defeated the big, evil dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and rescued the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, he earned the pennant of his dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re always running off and causing me trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop following me, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:08:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to make a cup of strawberry juice to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m getting revenge on you right this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,An abandoned bee?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let my friend go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Decided to come to me by yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to regret that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Morning Sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Morning Sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning Sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot that you can't attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got mutton to eat and bees to vent at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you hurt her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s not a bee. You’ve got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll check whether or not she's a bee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening? I'm blinded!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, she's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does she look kind of familiar, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I’ve seen her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s the bee princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Security!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.10,0:11:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was he who kidnapped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you disrespect Her Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to "explain"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Little girl—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you’ll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it, Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a pennant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A lollipop?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm! A thick honey flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s my pennant!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
